#### burst of 3, then refused

### POST /api/send  (auth: bearer)
> {"recipient":"79990000002","message":"hi"}
< 500
< Content-Type: application/json
{"success":false,"message":"Not connected to WhatsApp"}

### POST /api/send  (auth: bearer)
> {"recipient":"79990000002","message":"hi"}
< 500
< Content-Type: application/json
{"success":false,"message":"Not connected to WhatsApp"}

### POST /api/send  (auth: bearer)
> {"recipient":"79990000002","message":"hi"}
< 500
< Content-Type: application/json
{"success":false,"message":"Not connected to WhatsApp"}

### POST /api/send  (auth: bearer)
> {"recipient":"79990000002","message":"hi"}
< 429
< Content-Type: application/json
< Retry-After: 7
{"success":false,"message":"send rate limit reached (WHATSAPP_SEND_RATE); try again in 7s"}

#### validation failures use tokens too

### POST /api/react  (auth: bearer)
> {}
< 429
< Content-Type: application/json
< Retry-After: 7
{"success":false,"message":"send rate limit reached (WHATSAPP_SEND_RATE); try again in 7s"}

#### signal-only and own-account routes are not limited

### POST /api/read  (auth: bearer)
> {"chat_jid":"79990000002@s.whatsapp.net"}
< 500
< Content-Type: application/json
{"success":false,"message":"Not connected to WhatsApp"}

### POST /api/typing  (auth: bearer)
> {"chat_jid":"79990000002"}
< 500
< Content-Type: application/json
{"success":false,"message":"Not connected to WhatsApp"}

### POST /api/chat  (auth: bearer)
> {"chat_jid":"79990000002","action":"pin"}
< 500
< Content-Type: application/json
{"success":false,"message":"Not connected to WhatsApp"}

### POST /api/star  (auth: bearer)
> {"chat_jid":"79990000002@s.whatsapp.net","message_id":"IN1"}
< 500
< Content-Type: application/json
{"success":false,"message":"Not connected to WhatsApp"}

#### 6 s later: passes although Retry-After said 7

### POST /api/send  (auth: bearer)
> {"recipient":"79990000002","message":"hi"}
< 500
< Content-Type: application/json
{"success":false,"message":"Not connected to WhatsApp"}

#### 7 s later: one more token, then refused again

### POST /api/send  (auth: bearer)
> {"recipient":"79990000002","message":"hi"}
< 500
< Content-Type: application/json
{"success":false,"message":"Not connected to WhatsApp"}

### POST /api/group/create  (auth: bearer)
> {"name":"Depot","participants":["79990000002"]}
< 429
< Content-Type: application/json
< Retry-After: 6
{"success":false,"message":"send rate limit reached (WHATSAPP_SEND_RATE); try again in 6s"}

#### a minute later: tokens for every route that reaches others

### POST /api/react  (auth: bearer)
> {}
< 400
< Content-Type: text/plain; charset=utf-8
< X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
chat_jid and message_id are required

